{"ref":"BDB, כּוֹס²","hw":"כּוֹס²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹס</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] a kind of <strong>owl (</strong>according to Vrss; v. Kn-Di <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.17\">Lv 11:17</a>; wd. perhaps onomatop.<strong>)</strong>—unclean bird <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.17\">Lv 11:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.16\">Dt 14:16</a>, dwelling in ruins <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ חֳרָבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:7\" href=\"/Psalms.102.7\">ψ 102:7</a>","next":"BDB, כור","prev":"BDB, כּוֹס"}